WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.299
1. Open the supplier and choose Business reviews, then Add business review. Procurement, admins and the supplier's relationship owner can.

2
00:00:02.299 --> 00:00:11.231
2. Enter when it was held, who attended and a short summary.

3
00:00:11.231 --> 00:00:17.668
3. Give an overall rating, and score quality, delivery, service and cost from 1 to 5.

4
00:00:17.668 --> 00:00:27.419
4. Click Add an action for each thing agreed: what, who and when. Then set when the next review is due.

5
00:00:27.419 --> 00:00:35.194
5. Click Add review, then Attach a file for the deck or minutes. Each action's owner is emailed and sees it on Home until they tick it done.
